WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.345
The BRRRR method means buy, rehab, rent, refinance, repeat.

2
00:00:04.345 --> 00:00:09.423
The goal is to pull most of your cash back out and keep a rental that pays.

3
00:00:09.423 --> 00:00:12.809
Here's how to check a BRRRR deal in EquityFoundry.

4
00:00:13.609 --> 00:00:15.191
Choose BRRRR at the top.

5
00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:17.235
It's part of EquityFoundry Pro.

6
00:00:18.035 --> 00:00:22.067
Enter the purchase price, your rehab budget, and the closing costs.

7
00:00:24.625 --> 00:00:26.812
Now the part that makes BRRRR work.

8
00:00:26.812 --> 00:00:31.434
Enter the after-repair value, what the home will be worth once it's fixed.

9
00:00:31.434 --> 00:00:34.932
Add how many months the rehab takes, then the refinance:

10
00:00:34.932 --> 00:00:41.116
the loan-to-value your lender allows, the new rate and term, and the closing costs on the new loan.

11
00:00:41.916 --> 00:00:47.024
Add the rent you expect once the work is done, and the loan you'll use to buy it.

12
00:00:47.024 --> 00:00:53.393
Rehab loans often carry higher rates, and EquityFoundry counts what you pay while the work gets done.

13
00:00:54.193 --> 00:00:56.164
Then the taxes and insurance.

14
00:00:56.164 --> 00:01:00.039
Maintenance and future big repairs are already set aside.

15
00:01:00.839 --> 00:01:02.102
Here's your answer.

16
00:01:02.102 --> 00:01:04.095
Cash flow after the refinance.

17
00:01:04.095 --> 00:01:09.147
Cash left in the deal, what's still tied up once the new loan pays you back.

18
00:01:09.147 --> 00:01:12.736
And equity after the refinance, the value you created.

19
00:01:12.736 --> 00:01:15.793
The less cash left in, the stronger the BRRRR.

20
00:01:16.593 --> 00:01:23.185
Open buy, rehab and refinance to follow your cash through every stage, from purchase to payoff.

21
00:01:23.985 --> 00:01:29.370
If too much cash stays in the deal, try a lower price or a leaner rehab.

22
00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:31.240
Then save it and compare.

23
00:01:31.240 --> 00:01:35.578
Run yours at octopisceslabs.com/rental-calc.

24
00:01:35.578 --> 00:01:36.999
Forge better deals.
